generate_topologies

# Pin the exact topologies that were buggy in the full big2.buda run, now fixed:
#   bundle 1 (b4)=TRUNK_H@y4887 (topo 4)  — NUTS span-adjust used to detach blk_12
#                                            (fixed: BUSTERM face anchors in NUTS)
#   bundle 2 (b24)=TRUNK_V@x5485 (topo 8) — generation used to leave blk_09 uncovered
#                                            (fixed: coverage-safe stub suppression).
# The TRUNK_V candidate index moved (4->8) once blk_09's stub is no longer dropped.
select_topology 1 4
select_topology 2 8
# Check the SELECTED topologies before planning so a topology-gen coverage gap
# (bundle 24 / blk_09) is caught at the topo stage and can't be masked by a later
# NUTS/DNUTS change. Bundle 4's detach is a NUTS-stage artifact (clean at topo).
check_design topo
run_planner
run_nuts
check_design nuts
run_detailed_nuts
check_design
exit
